# The dive and the range-first target order together (dive 3, prio 1).
# Two verbs aimed at the same gun from different seats: the dive is a
# detached party of the three fastest gathered units closing on the
# nearest visible ground mover that outranges every land gun the army
# fields (rw_bot.policy.dive), and prio 1 is the kill-groups' own target
# order, longest enemy reach first before convergence breaks ties
# (rw_bot.policy.firing, PRIO_RANGE). Measured apart on the nine Very
# Hard opener seeds (log 2026-09-13): the dive flips s8914041, s8916121
# and s8916641 under the raid's draft arbitration, and range-first
# flips s8915185, a seed the dive leaves wiped, so the composition is
# the first arm that could reach four of nine. The party is withheld
# from the kill-groups, so the two orders never contend for a unit.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-dive3-prange
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
